        "kind": "context-hygiene",
        "explanation": "Context that is carried on after the task is done is paid on every request. These sessions came near the limit of the context window without a compaction, or were compacted again and again instead of starting fresh.",
        "action": "Clear the context between tasks (`/clear` in Claude Code, a new session in the other clients), compact before the limit (`/compact`), and keep sessions short.",
        "count": 3,
