      {
        "rank": 4,
        "kind": "skill-quality",
        "explanation": "Skills with signs of a problem: loaded twice into the same context, loaded by the model without any work following, never picked by the model although listed, or followed by failing work. These are signals from the order of events, not proof.",
        "action": "Repeat loads: say in the body that the skill is loaded once per task. Misfires: narrow the description to the situations it is for. Only started by /name: mark it as not automatically invoked (Claude Code: `disable-model-invocation: true`), so it leaves the listing. Errors or retry loops after it: check the commands, paths and scripts the skill gives. Compaction soon after: shorten the body or move steps into a script.",
